WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,020
Hold it, hold the winter melon together.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:16,020
I know you don’t have a refrigerator outside and the lettuce can’t be stored well, so I will decorate less.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:23,500
For other vegetables, take a box and poke a few small holes to prevent it from getting stuffy. It can be stored for a few more days.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:33,570
OK remember

5
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:36,570
Do you want tomatoes? Are there fresh tomatoes?

6
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:50,360
I want it, I want it. Where did the tomatoes come from?

7
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:53,730
Go ahead and eat

8
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:58,540
Given by a grandma

9
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:02,540
Is the field large? The loss is not terrible. None of you were injured, right?

10
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:07,540
The field was big and the losses were terrible, but we were all fine and uninjured.

11
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:09,610
Did you listen to your mother?

12
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:10,610
Of course there is
